/Slide_029_操夢.wav","telop":"「自動運転中の全列車の一斉停止と、\n大宮駅付近の最寄り電車を駅に入線する。」","id":"A3BEC0F4-CFDA-4C44-816E-385758C1E346","slideTitle":"スライド #29","duration":6.490861678004535,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.029.jpeg","title":"シーン 29","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":5.890861678004535},{"characterName":"ナレーション","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_030_ナレーション.wav","telop":"「承知しました、全列車に一斉停止コードを送信します…、通信中です…、コードを作成中です…、コードを送信しました…」","id":"0D6E9C7A-B0C2-4D74-B6BD-3E66CCA45897","slideTitle":"スライド #30","duration":8.916938775510204,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.030.jpeg","title":"シーン 30","audioTrack":"track_voice__E1DB","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.316938775510204},{"characterName":"ナレーション","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_031_ナレーション.wav","telop":"「現状を確認中です…大宮駅付近で止まっている最寄り列車を探しています…大宮公園で現在停止中の列車があります。」","id":"C0474919-5C30-47B9-BDB6-2AFFC755C7CE","slideTitle":"スライド #31","duration":8.873469387755101,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.031.jpeg","title":"シーン 31","audioTrack":"track_voice__E1DB","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.273469387755101},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_032_操夢.wav","telop":"僕は、それを聞くと、操作盤を触り、\nある人物に電話をかける…。","id":"F7B0F83D-E9B7-4577-A6EB-89414998E59F","slideTitle":"スライド #32","duration":5.114761904761904,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.032.jpeg","title":"シーン 32","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":4.5147619047619045},{"telop":"彼が発信先の人は…","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":3.5,"title":"シーン 33","characterName":"ナレーション","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","id":"0B188165-E1A0-4E23-A34F-BFF95164759E","animationName":"なし","slideTitle":"スライド #33","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.033.jpeg"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_034_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"私は、ただ一人、手持ちのノートPC上で臨時記者会見の様子を見ていると、ふとポケベルの着信に気づく。","id":"3F714856-497C-4270-87E9-E6163FB937AB","slideTitle":"スライド #34","duration":9.407732426303854,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.034.jpeg","title":"シーン 34","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.807732426303854},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_035_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「もしもし、操夢、どうしたの？」","id":"61DC56FF-47AD-4808-82AC-2A19253FE95A","slideTitle":"スライド #35","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.035.jpeg","title":"シーン 35","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":2.7094784580498867},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_036_操夢.wav","telop":"「あんなことがあった後の電話で、こう言うのもなんですが、霊夢さんは、総理と僕だったら、どっちがいいですか？」","id":"FFEF34B3-133A-4C09-A5BA-47958EA46CC5","slideTitle":"スライド #36","duration":8.15607709750567,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.036.jpeg","title":"シーン 36","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":7.556077097505669},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_037_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「えっ、それってどういう？」","id":"0511E236-B709-4EA2-8E28-573404EF9262","slideTitle":"スライド #37","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.037.jpeg","title":"シーン 37","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":1.8919954648526076},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_038_操夢.wav","telop":"「今流れている記者会見を見ればわかりますが、総理は僕のことを前面に押し出して、問題の真相は闇に封印する気です。」","id":"D6E32C42-A785-4D3A-AFA9-2C974C4D19B4","slideTitle":"スライド #38","duration":8.70390022675737,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.038.jpeg","title":"シーン 38","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.10390022675737},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_039_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「それで…」","id":"022553A0-FF45-4FDE-89C7-6257ED063B96","slideTitle":"スライド #39","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.039.jpeg","title":"シーン 39","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":1.5},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_040_操夢.wav","telop":"「手短に言うと、政府の味方になれば、この問題を闇に葬る代わりに、総理直々の罰が霊夢さんに降るの明確です。」","id":"1B4D4553-B44E-40E9-BF3D-0B1FC10BBB64","slideTitle":"スライド #40","duration":8.947369614512471,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.040.jpeg","title":"シーン 40","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.347369614512472},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_041_操夢.wav","telop":"「ですが、僕につけば、文さんと交渉して、世間を誤魔化して、これまで通り、巫女として働き、お仕置きもしません。」","id":"3207790E-B70D-4A9B-88FB-B050C16FF9F2","slideTitle":"スライド #41","duration":8.936507936507937,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.041.jpeg","title":"シーン 41","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.336507936507937},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_操夢.wav","telop":"「両者とも、この問題を闇に葬るのには変わりませんが、霊夢さんなら、きっと僕につけば、より利にかなってますよ。」","id":"494465E0-6A41-4530-AD8C-9A63D8576FE3","slideTitle":"スライド #42","duration":8.495215419501134,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.042.jpeg","title":"シーン 42","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":7.895215419501134},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_操夢.wav","telop":"「ただ一つ難点を言うなら、この騒動が鎮静になるまで、霊夢さんと必要なら魔理沙さんたちも、家には帰れません。」","id":"7DBD90A0-CB0B-44BB-8B45-92197BE3593B","slideTitle":"スライド #43","duration":8.347369614512472,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.043.jpeg","title":"シーン 43","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":7.747369614512472},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_操夢.wav","telop":"「ですが、今僕がプログラムを送りつけて、文さんの協力を確実に得られれば、沈静化までそう長くはかかりません。」","id":"AE38CF4F-F097-4D5A-9434-90593CC25453","slideTitle":"スライド #44","duration":8.469115646258503,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.044.jpeg","title":"シーン 44","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":7.8691156462585035},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_操夢.wav","telop":"「この難点にさえ、目を瞑れば、何も不自由なく、これまでと近い形で生活を送り続けられます。さてどうしますか？」","id":"5ACDD38A-90D5-4A3D-AF56-0612E88F6DEC","slideTitle":"スライド #45","duration":9.023469387755101,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.045.jpeg","title":"シーン 45","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.423469387755102},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_046_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「そう…」私はそう返す…、今ここで彼について、少しの間だけ我慢すれば、これまで通りの生活を送れるが、迷いがある。","id":"C82337AE-B566-495F-A18D-EF3008A3703F","slideTitle":"スライド #46","duration":10.431995464852607,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.046.jpeg","title":"シーン 46","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":9.831995464852607},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_047_操夢.wav","telop":"「霊夢さん、何か、僕のプランに問題がありますか、\nそれとも何かしらの要望がありますか？」","id":"987218F6-5D76-45AB-A420-1EAC298DD362","slideTitle":"スライド #47","duration":6.836507936507936,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.047.jpeg","title":"シーン 47","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":6.2365079365079366},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_048_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"私はそう言われ、考えると、ふとあの気配を感じ、\nポケベルをPCからとり耳に当てながら、飛んでいく。","id":"0BACDC15-9458-45BD-B975-4189BE57A0DF","slideTitle":"スライド #48","duration":8.589478458049888,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.048.jpeg","title":"シーン 48","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":7.989478458049887},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_049_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"すると、彼が何かを言い始め、それに耳を傾ける。","id":"0695A72D-D689-4267-91CB-4DA21B9B7A0C","slideTitle":"スライド #49","duration":4.869478458049886,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.049.jpeg","title":"シーン 49","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","voiceDuration":4.269478458049886},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_050_操夢.wav","telop":"「霊夢さん、今、空を飛んでますか？」","id":"ECE7ADC8-C890-4B56-9B99-2B8381DCAE79","slideTitle":"スライド #50","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.050.jpeg","title":"シーン 50","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":2.673469387755102},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「ええ、そうよ。それでどうすればいいの？」","id":"CB3042D0-FEE0-44B0-AB0A-62002725F74B","slideTitle":"スライド #51","duration":3.849478458049887,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.051.jpeg","title":"シーン 51","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","voiceDuration":3.2494784580498868},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_052_操夢.wav","telop":"「今、大宮公園の列車を動かし始めたので、列車のカメラを見ながら、僕の合図で空いている扉から乗り込んでください。」","id":"AC9FE598-EC0C-4F13-A49D-1645863B73C1","slideTitle":"スライド #52","duration":8.558253968253968,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.052.jpeg","title":"シーン 52","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":7.958253968253969},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_053_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「それって、どういう…」","id":"2AC23781-FF8D-4AA5-B4DD-A4E66E5EE123","slideTitle":"スライド #53","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.053.jpeg","title":"シーン 53","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","voiceDuration":1.6732426303854875},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_054_操夢.wav","telop":"「今、列車の映像を見てます…」僕はそう言いながら、その列車から空に向けられているカメラの映像を確認する。","id":"EBBB7FF5-B2DC-4D7C-AD41-2601B79C97EB","slideTitle":"スライド #54","duration":7.9799999999999995,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.054.jpeg","title":"シーン 54","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":7.38},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_055_操夢.wav","telop":"そして、しばらく経つと、彼女の姿が写り、\n「今です。」と言い、列車を減速させ、最寄りの扉を開く。","id":"CA7602DC-571E-4DED-8261-7C9744C5BD95","slideTitle":"スライド #55","duration":8.295215419501133,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.055.jpeg","title":"シーン 55","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":7.6952154195011335},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_056_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"私は彼の言うタイミングで、列車に乗り込むと、即座に扉がしまる。ふと周りを見ると、空気輸送していたようだった。","id":"E45789F0-4E3E-44B8-A6DB-67173E0C991F","slideTitle":"スライド #56","duration":9.935736961451246,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.056.jpeg","title":"シーン 56","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":9.335736961451246},{"characterName":"ナレーション","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_057_ナレーション.wav","telop":"「この列車は、臨時特別快速、甲子線直通、八王子行きです。途中の停車駅は中浦和のみとなります。」","id":"1B8BFC1C-2397-48C4-9D62-10F4C819E133","slideTitle":"スライド #57","duration":8.869115646258503,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.057.jpeg","title":"シーン 57","audioTrack":"track_voice__E1DB","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":8.269115646258504},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_058_操夢.wav","telop":"僕は、列車の車内カメラで、彼女が乗り込みと同時に、扉閉め、最大限の加速を列車にさせる。「霊夢さん、聞こえますか？」","id":"5D7F1DBE-199F-4C62-A402-8B802D882D64","slideTitle":"スライド #58","duration":9.666938775510204,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.058.jpeg","title":"シーン 58","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":9.066938775510204},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_059_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「なんだか、とんでもない速度が出てる気がするんだけど…」","id":"53472890-3EF1-4169-9D7B-8E8DA83EBCB3","slideTitle":"スライド #59","duration":4.654489795918367,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.059.jpeg","title":"シーン 59","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":4.054489795918367},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_060_操夢.wav","telop":"「今、列車は限界速度の時速150kmなので、\nここまでだったら、おそらく数十分でつきますよ。」","id":"B0C3C0D8-CD3D-4D4C-8284-2F60E7F60E8B","slideTitle":"スライド #60","duration":8.399546485260771,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.060.jpeg","title":"シーン 60","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":7.7995464852607705},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_061_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「そっ、そう…」","id":"D7254C9F-26FF-4835-A9CD-16DDB0DF265E","slideTitle":"スライド #61","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.061.jpeg","title":"シーン 61","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":1.5},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_062_操夢.wav","telop":"僕はそう言いながら、家にいるフランたちにメッセージを送る。","id":"419FAA4E-33F6-498F-9962-7A4D7349A83F","slideTitle":"スライド #62","duration":4.140861678004535,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.062.jpeg","title":"シーン 62","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":3.540861678004535},{"telop":"その頃フランたちは…","backgroundName":"単色背景","duration":3,"title":"シーン 63: その頃フランたちは…","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","id":"13EFED19-C353-4EDC-9737-68B81C526DD0","animationName":"なし","slideTitle":"スライド #63","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.063.jpeg"},{"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_064_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","telop":"私は、ふとポケベルから音がして、見ると、操夢からメッセージが来ていた。私は、その内容を他の皆に伝える。","id":"35554832-814C-4652-B5E7-FA0F06D77F47","slideTitle":"スライド #64","duration":9.869478458049887,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.064.jpeg","title":"シーン 64","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","voiceDuration":9.269478458049887},{"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_065_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","telop":"すると、この家に住む霊夢以外の全員に同じ文言が送られていることがわかり、私たちは、準備をすまして、家を出るのだった。","id":"E0234F94-96A5-4FC5-AF9D-834348C74088","slideTitle":"スライド #65","duration":10.498979591836735,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.065.jpeg","title":"シーン 65","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","voiceDuration":9.898979591836735},{"telop":"霊夢の列車が駅に止まると…","backgroundName":"単色背景","duration":3,"title":"シーン 66: 霊夢の列車が駅に止まると…","characterName":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","id":"4B37B12A-5F4A-4423-92B1-9F583CBD1B09","animationName":"なし","slideTitle":"スライド #66","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.066.jpeg"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_067_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"それから、数分経つと、途中停車駅につき、ドアが開く。\nすると、そこからフランたちが乗ってくる。","id":"4A5C693C-6BD0-4CFE-8673-8967C2DD0FC9","slideTitle":"スライド #67","duration":8.886984126984126,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.067.jpeg","title":"シーン 67","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":8.286984126984127},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_068_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「もしかした、フランたちにも彼から何か来たの？」\n私は、再び猛加速をしだす、列車に腰掛けながら、尋ねる。","id":"3B6D7542-9ADD-4AE3-8948-3785B38B131C","slideTitle":"スライド #68","duration":10.284489795918367,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.068.jpeg","title":"シーン 68","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":9.684489795918367},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_069_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"そして、魔理沙の姿がないことに気づく。\nすると、車内放送…ではなく彼の声が聞こえる。","id":"A342FB87-AF11-40A3-84B6-6FEB2770F018","slideTitle":"スライド #69","duration":8.096984126984127,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.069.jpeg","title":"シーン 69","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":7.496984126984127},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_070_操夢.wav","telop":"「魔理沙さんは、ちょうど近くにいたようなので、今こっちにいますよ。どうします、マイク機能があるので会話もできますが…」","id":"DD67BB99-E9B9-4A99-96DD-15BBBF5B6BBD","slideTitle":"スライド #70","duration":8.547369614512471,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.070.jpeg","title":"シーン 70","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":7.947369614512471},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_071_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「…魔理沙の声…聞かせてちょうだい…。」","id":"2DB9FDF7-8E6D-4303-938D-B48DA58251C0","slideTitle":"スライド #71","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.071.jpeg","title":"シーン 71","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":2.5419954648526075},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_072_操夢.wav","telop":"「どうやら、霊夢さんがあなたと話したいみたいです、僕は、ちょっと席を外すので、あとはお任せしますね。」","id":"217C310F-6508-457E-A469-34AA941B7F99","slideTitle":"スライド #72","duration":7.745215419501133,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.072.jpeg","title":"シーン 72","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":7.145215419501134},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_073_操夢.wav","telop":"僕はそう言うと、その部屋から離れた。","id":"E8E4902C-9505-4BB3-8914-2A8BDCE2577C","slideTitle":"スライド #73","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.073.jpeg","title":"シーン 73","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":2.514761904761905},{"characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_074_霧雨魔理沙.wav","telop":"私は、ただ部屋に一人残され、何気なく、霊夢に話しかける。\n「なぁ、霊夢…お前が競馬で大儲けしたってのは本当なのか？」","id":"E8BC1C14-FD93-4EEB-B86B-E9231685E3A4","slideTitle":"スライド #74","duration":11.091995464852607,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.074.jpeg","title":"シーン 74","audioTrack":"track_voice_marisa","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":10.491995464852607},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_075_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「確かに…共同口座のお金と早苗の奇跡の力で、がっぽり儲けたのは、本当なのよ…、でもちょっとして出来心で…」","id":"3160D197-8D28-40D9-A5CB-4DF8372FE695","slideTitle":"スライド #75","duration":10.016984126984127,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.075.jpeg","title":"シーン 75","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":9.416984126984127},{"characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_076_霧雨魔理沙.wav","telop":"「そうか…、操夢が言ってた話だと、過去の口座の入出金を調べていたら、何回か不審な履歴があったと言ってたのだぜ…」","id":"D579063B-106E-4527-8F2E-12971D8E9174","slideTitle":"スライド #76","duration":9.926984126984127,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.076.jpeg","title":"シーン 76","audioTrack":"track_voice_marisa","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":9.326984126984128},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_077_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"私は、その指摘を受け、ズキズキと心に何かが刺さる…。\n「えっと…、それは…」","id":"03018356-0DA9-4C49-8A59-FD5DC08C0A8A","slideTitle":"スライド #77","duration":7.005736961451247,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.077.jpeg","title":"シーン 77","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":6.405736961451248},{"characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_078_霧雨魔理沙.wav","telop":"「なあ、一つ聞きたいんだけど、\n霊夢の収入が少ないと感じるのは…」","id":"B4871E27-1A96-404B-BF13-2A577EE59197","slideTitle":"スライド #78","duration":5.861995464852607,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.078.jpeg","title":"シーン 78","audioTrack":"track_voice_marisa","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":5.261995464852608},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_079_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「えっと…」私は、その空気と彼女の問いかけに、平常心を保とうとするが、保てず、どうすればいいか迷う。","id":"8F139E10-E46D-49F8-9C54-928294448466","slideTitle":"スライド #79","duration":9.690748299319727,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.079.jpeg","title":"シーン 79","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":9.090748299319728},{"characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_080_霧雨魔理沙.wav","telop":"「まぁ、これを真に受けて、これからは、しっかり生きていくならいいと、操夢は、私がここに着いた時に言ってたぜ…」","id":"4A50B0A8-3F44-4C5A-99B5-62A84BE22D4A","slideTitle":"スライド #80","duration":9.364489795918367,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.080.jpeg","title":"シーン 80","audioTrack":"track_voice_marisa","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.764489795918367},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_081_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"「うぐ…」私は、魔理沙の発言にそう返すことしかできなかった。そして、彼の心意気に感謝をするのだった。","id":"9F129D73-450D-4252-BDC0-21F3C024970C","slideTitle":"スライド #81","duration":9.559478458049886,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.081.jpeg","title":"シーン 81","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":8.959478458049887},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_082_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"だが、それは同時に、ついこないだ、全員が思い知った、\n”彼”と皆との関係性にとって、大きな転換点だった。","id":"415E1C9D-FF65-43DE-963D-994522B55D82","slideTitle":"スライド #82","duration":9.620748299319727,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.082.jpeg","title":"シーン 82","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":9.020748299319727},{"telop":"その頃、操夢は…","backgroundName":"単色背景","duration":3,"title":"シーン 83: その頃、操夢は…","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","id":"E96BDE2C-585A-4AAA-92D5-DA3180928B0D","animationName":"なし","slideTitle":"スライド #83","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.083.jpeg"},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_084_操夢.wav","telop":"僕は、部屋から出て壁に寄りかかると、ポケベルを取り出し、ある連絡先に、電話をかける。すると、相手がすぐに出る。","id":"9E362828-4E15-41B4-AA48-1EAF934E435E","slideTitle":"スライド #84","duration":8.958253968253969,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.084.jpeg","title":"シーン 84","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.358253968253969},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_085_操夢.wav","telop":"「もしもし、聞こえますか？」\n僕は声を抑えながら、そう言う。","id":"F4B04898-FF52-489E-A209-26B92173375F","slideTitle":"スライド #85","duration":4.847369614512472,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.085.jpeg","title":"シーン 85","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":4.247369614512472},{"characterName":"射命丸文","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_086_射命丸文.wav","telop":"「ええ、どうしました？何かスクープでもあるのですか？」","id":"A636D423-DFE0-4057-B08B-9EA44413CE5D","slideTitle":"スライド #86","duration":4.035578231292517,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.086.jpeg","title":"シーン 86","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":3.435578231292517},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_087_操夢.wav","telop":"「いえ、今回はスクープではありませんが、例のスクープ記事について、ちょっとお願いがあるのですが？」","id":"5E56BBAD-2689-4690-A0D7-76A066224A8D","slideTitle":"スライド #87","duration":6.790861678004535,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.087.jpeg","title":"シーン 87","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":6.190861678004535},{"characterName":"射命丸文","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_088_射命丸文.wav","telop":"「何か、心配事でもあるのですが？」","id":"66E3C93B-D8C6-496D-808F-D77FA0C8E4C7","slideTitle":"スライド #88","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.088.jpeg","title":"シーン 88","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":2.3035827664399093},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_089_操夢.wav","telop":"「ええ、あの問題の続報になるかもしれないですが、文さんにはあの記者会見の内容の否定と、協力のお願いをしたくて…」","id":"2E2D8D62-1C29-442B-B13F-BB9294C684F1","slideTitle":"スライド #89","duration":8.669115646258502,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.089.jpeg","title":"シーン 89","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.069115646258503},{"characterName":"射命丸文","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_090_射命丸文.wav","telop":"「お願い…もし、内密な話なのであれば、\nそちらにお伺いしましょうか？」","id":"0FF180E8-EEB2-47A3-AC58-6740A25372FE","slideTitle":"スライド #90","duration":5.289591836734694,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.090.jpeg","title":"シーン 90","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":4.689591836734694},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_091_操夢.wav","telop":"「いえ、あの家は、しばらく手放す予定なので、文さんでお願いを話せればいいかと…」僕は、ボソボソと呟くように言う。","id":"69DBD037-4866-4B17-B244-27302B8CD3D8","slideTitle":"スライド #91","duration":8.619115646258503,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.091.jpeg","title":"シーン 91","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.019115646258504},{"characterName":"射命丸文","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_092_射命丸文.wav","telop":"「わかりました…それで、話し合いは、今夜にしますか？」","id":"42319FD7-227C-4523-9418-A1091D49E604","slideTitle":"スライド #92","duration":4.1355782312925164,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.092.jpeg","title":"シーン 92","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":3.535578231292517},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_093_操夢.wav","telop":"「ええ、それでお願いします。」","id":"FEB56069-6E7A-4438-9683-473A911F4877","slideTitle":"スライド #93","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.093.jpeg","title":"シーン 93","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":1.9039002267573697},{"characterName":"射命丸文","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_094_射命丸文.wav","telop":"「承知しました。では、今晩、お待ちしてますね。」","id":"33D278A8-E142-47D3-B794-8FB110FC172B","slideTitle":"スライド #94","duration":4.159591836734694,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.094.jpeg","title":"シーン 94","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":3.5595918367346937},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_095_操夢.wav","telop":"「わかりました。では失礼します。」\n僕はそう言うと、通話を切る。そして、部屋に戻る。","id":"E032F0A3-EF61-41C5-83E2-D29BEE220B1B","slideTitle":"スライド #95","duration":7.314761904761904,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.095.jpeg","title":"シーン 95","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":6.714761904761905},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_096_操夢.wav","telop":"そして、部屋に戻るとあることを思い出し、操作盤を触る。\nそして、列車が減速しているのを確認する。","id":"10B02DF7-6902-4B33-9275-8E7015D39365","slideTitle":"スライド #96","duration":7.412607709750566,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.096.jpeg","title":"シーン 96","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":6.812607709750567},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_097_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"すると、少しだけ列車が揺れたあと、スピードがだんだんと落ちていき、数十秒程度で、ドアが開いた。","id":"5CFABB84-6563-4232-83DD-865E2F2CA2E6","slideTitle":"スライド #97","duration":8.321995464852607,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.097.jpeg","title":"シーン 97","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","voiceDuration":7.721995464852608},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_098_操夢.wav","telop":"そして、それから10分程度で全員がこの部屋に出揃った。\n僕はそれから、これからの計画、プランを話し始めた。","id":"922D49B5-DB49-4D58-B270-0D7CE3D4FF4B","slideTitle":"スライド #98","duration":8.607165532879819,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.098.jpeg","title":"シーン 98","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceDuration":8.007165532879819},{"telop":"次回予告","backgroundName":"単色背景","duration":3,"title":"シーン 99: 次回予告","characterName":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","id":"BE376B40-9470-4D4A-A064-5D3FEB848BB1","animationName":"なし","slideTitle":"スライド #99","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.099.jpeg"},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_100_操夢.wav","telop":"僕はそれから、この場にいる全員に、これからの計画、プランを話していく。そうしていくうちに、夕方になる。","id":"8CB91C98-F0C6-4B4F-AC9B-9C14AD60AA18","slideTitle":"スライド #100","duration":8.30172335600907,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.100.jpeg","title":"シーン 100","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceDuration":7.7017233560090705},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_101_操夢.wav","telop":"そして僕は、不要になったシステムなどの権限を放棄すると、\nそのまま、文の家にやってくる。","id":"92EAD767-E398-47CB-86EB-F42D1E4FA448","slideTitle":"スライド #101","duration":6.7647619047619045,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.101.jpeg","title":"シーン 101","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":6.164761904761905},{"cha